"  - Review the [Batch API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/batch#batch) reference.\n"
"  - Understand the [Job limits](/guides/job-limits) when sending a job to an IBM&reg; QPU.\n"
"  - Review [execution modes FAQs](/guides/execution-modes-faq).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"המלצות\">\n"
"  - נסו דוגמה במדריך [שילוב אפשרויות הפחתת שגיאות עם ה-Estimator primitive](/tutorials/combine-error-mitigation-techniques).\n"
